A lich is no help at all in the valley of the dead because zombies and
mummies are cold resistant and liches don't wield weapons. Plus,
liches are horrible pets in the first place. If you need a new pet and
have a source of fire resistance, then burn "Elbereth" and repeatedly
sit on a magic trap in one of the deeper dungeon levels.

Thing is, I'd still dig for him because he'll teleport right next to
you when you reach the correct level. It's a race against time to get
him before he goes wild, anyway. Your AC is more than sufficient for a
dig for victory, and at this point you could simply use the drawbridge
trick to crush most of the castle occupants.


